questions.question_text:
The network below shows the activities in a printing job, with durations in minutes.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\usetikzlibrary{decorations.markings}
\tikzset{midarrow/.style={decoration={markings, mark=at position 0.5 with {\arrow{>}}}, postaction={decorate}}}
\coordinate (S) at (0,0);
\coordinate (P) at (2,1.3);
\coordinate (Q) at (2,-1.3);
\coordinate (R) at (4.4,0);
\coordinate (T) at (6.4,0);
\coordinate (Z) at (8.4,0);
\draw[midarrow] (S) -- (P) node[pos=0.35, fill=white, inner sep=1pt] {$A,\,4$};
\draw[midarrow] (S) -- (Q) node[pos=0.35, fill=white, inner sep=1pt] {$B,\,6$};
\draw[midarrow] (P) -- (R) node[pos=0.35, fill=white, inner sep=1pt] {$C,\,2$};
\draw[midarrow] (Q) -- (R) node[pos=0.35, fill=white, inner sep=1pt] {$D,\,5$};
\draw[midarrow] (R) -- (T) node[pos=0.35, fill=white, inner sep=1pt] {$E,\,3$};
\draw[midarrow] (T) -- (Z) node[pos=0.35, fill=white, inner sep=1pt] {$F,\,7$};
\fill (S) circle (2.5pt);
\fill (P) circle (2.5pt);
\fill (Q) circle (2.5pt);
\fill (R) circle (2.5pt);
\fill (T) circle (2.5pt);
\fill (Z) circle (2.5pt);
\node[font=\small, left] at (S) {Start};
\node[font=\small, right] at (Z) {Finish};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
Which activity has $C$ and $D$ as its immediate predecessors?

